{"version":1,"content":"<p>鄭希怡（Yumiko）前天（26日）突然無預警在社交平台公開一張手抱初生嬰兒、並與女兒「梁浸浸」同框的合照。</p><p>她當時更配文寫道「屋企多咗一個新成員」，隨即引發廣大網民的好奇與討論，不少人甚至誤以為她再傳喜訊，紛紛留言送上祝賀。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T05:58:48.018650+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T05:13:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T02:18:20.147558+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T05:58:48.018650+00:00","content_hash":"6dc82d357e5be8986ba4d1efc19a839c6e626363934c29f8d0458fccc4841e25","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}